{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006194055_d0cff1fe","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_46233539c7ca14530e11033b","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006194055_d0cff1fe","chunk_index":7,"job_id":"mwjob_c9bbf055d4d22e31efffb1db","precondition_digest":"ae9cedc141106e5e430beb62d18a37b02195351499d3c84827d77781412af1cc","project_id":"proj_user_3084cb2bd954","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_bbe117d920a75574","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_09ae1f280ec3996c","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_8d26e523850a148d","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_3e154cdc77b188d3"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006194055_d0cff1fe","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"核心期访视：第4、8、12周（IPSS、生命体征、AE、依从性；第12周加尿流率+PVR）","quote_sha256":"e165048530675efd4bd528d357009d05a5de02ba109d7135f878a41cdcec27d3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"R7A-BD502缓释片75mg/片（与外观一致dummy片双模拟），每日一次每次一片，晨起空腹或餐后2小时整片吞服；双盲核心期12周（84±3天）+延长期40周，全程共52周。","quote_sha256":"a5c4ac0fd6737be633586215b29ccd70ff4c502dc8ee57f74461bd941bae9a55","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"延长期访视：第24、36、52周（IPSS、QoL、血压心率、AE；第52周加尿流率）","quote_sha256":"35ee0a73cbc799ac90d325bb314a727ff76cfe043710bb7c826fea30e1ed66d9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es6"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es6"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充依从性评估方法学文件，明确药片计数、电子日记或其他核查方式及不依从定义","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_5_1","missing_source_classes":["依从性评估方法学文件"],"target":"依从性评估具体方法与不依从判定阈值"},{"action":"确认延长期第24、36、52周访视是否纳入依从性核查","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_5_2","missing_source_classes":["访视计划详细表"],"target":"延长期访视是否包含依从性评估"}],"heading":"研究治疗依从性","missing_source_classes":["依从性评估方法学文件","不依从处理SOP"],"proposal_text":"本研究治疗依从性评估在双盲核心期第4周、第8周和第12周访视时进行。受试者按方案规定每日一次口服R7A-BD502缓释片75mg或匹配安慰剂缓释片，每次一片，晨起空腹或餐后2小时整片吞服，不得掰开、咀嚼或碾碎。双盲核心期持续12周（84±3天），延长期持续40周，全程共52周。核心期各访视中，研究者应核查受试者自上次访视以来的用药依从情况，记录漏服、自行调整剂量或中断给药等事件。延长期第24周、第36周和第52周访视的评估项目为IPSS、QoL、血压心率及不良事件，依从性评估是否纳入延长期各访视需依据最终访视计划确定。","rationale":"核心期访视项目明确包含依从性评估，给药方案（75mg、每日一次、整片吞服、晨起空腹或餐后2小时）及治疗周期（12+40=52周）为已确认项目事实。延长期访视项目列表中未列出依从性，因此未将其写入延长期评估内容。依从性评估的具体方法（药片计数、电子日记或其他）及不依从处理规则在允许来源中未提供，需医学经理补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_bbe117d920a75574","section_number":"6.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cc94b1aa4283601f64986120","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1111caf38b4339","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:06652cfb5d7add","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a58b77f78a8621","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:176c87031ef7e6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:79890fa298bcdd"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006194055_d0cff1fe","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"两组全程允许稳定背景抗高血压治疗并按需非LUTS合并用药。","quote_sha256":"49152a016c4bb25e7a1729d1315033b45186d552f7d55acbfb5e838ea4aa2aab","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"同意研究期间不使用其他BPH/LUTS治疗药物（含植物制剂），并完成全部访视与电子日记","quote_sha256":"62f365f02030fea99c8d309d2979e65ca3f8a95d604e8edbceec2b005ffbc946","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"section:排除标准 | 恶性肿瘤|block:308|chunk:1","quote":"试验参与者使用了方案规定的禁止用药，经研究者和申办者讨论后决定是否终止治疗（具体禁止用药详见5.8 合并用药章节）；","quote_sha256":"74a62e5b8880ffdd6bd04674c397a922b58dc805b7bea4bf6561e1b736290235","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a58b77f78a8621","span_id":"es7"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es3","es4","es7"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充本项目禁止合并用药的具体药物及治疗类别清单","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_6_1","missing_source_classes":["禁止合并用药清单"],"target":"禁止合并用药完整清单"},{"action":"明确受试者使用禁止合并用药后是否强制停药、是否退出研究及是否继续随访","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_6_2","missing_source_classes":["安全性管理SOP"],"target":"使用禁止用药后的处理流程"},{"action":"确认合并用药是否影响主要分析集归属及敏感性分析策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_6_3","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"合并用药与主要终点交互分析规则"}],"heading":"合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["禁止合并用药完整清单","合并用药与终点交互分析规则","使用禁止用药后处理流程"],"proposal_text":"本研究允许两组受试者在整个52周治疗期间继续使用剂量稳定的背景抗高血压治疗，以及按需使用非LUTS适应证的合并用药或治疗。受试者在随机前已使用的、用于其他疾病的合并用药及治疗，若不属于本方案规定的禁止合并用药或治疗范畴，且研究者判断其剂量稳定，可在研究期间继续使用。研究者根据受试者疾病情况决定是否停用、加用或换用治疗药物；如发生加用或换用，应记录既往病史变化情况并评估是否需记录为不良事件。所有合并用药及治疗均须在病例报告表中如实记录药物名称、剂量、给药途径、起止日期及适应证。","rationale":"项目已确认事实明确'两组全程允许稳定背景抗高血压治疗并按需非LUTS合并用药'，入组标准要求不使用其他BPH/LUTS治疗药物（含植物制剂）。合并用药记录的一般性要求参照公司语料中跨适应症方案的章节结构，但具体禁止用药清单、使用禁止用药后的处理流程及合并用药与主要终点的交互分析规则在本项目来源中未提供。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_09ae1f280ec3996c","section_number":"6.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cc94b1aa4283601f64986120","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1111caf38b4339","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:06652cfb5d7add","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a58b77f78a8621","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:176c87031ef7e6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:79890fa298bcdd"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006194055_d0cff1fe","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"两组全程允许稳定背景抗高血压治疗并按需非LUTS合并用药。","quote_sha256":"49152a016c4bb25e7a1729d1315033b45186d552f7d55acbfb5e838ea4aa2aab","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"同意研究期间不使用其他BPH/LUTS治疗药物（含植物制剂），并完成全部访视与电子日记","quote_sha256":"62f365f02030fea99c8d309d2979e65ca3f8a95d604e8edbceec2b005ffbc946","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"α1阻滞剂/PDE5抑制剂（LUTS适应证）/抗胆碱能药随机前洗脱≥2周；5α还原酶抑制剂洗脱≥6个月；抗高血压药稳定≥4周不强制洗脱","quote_sha256":"87ecfb435d394dc051ef72b14fcdf9419eeb2184d3f53e43a7c0085019ce7ce3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es3","es4","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充允许使用的合并用药具体药物或类别清单","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_6_1_1","missing_source_classes":["允许合并用药清单"],"target":"允许合并用药具体药物清单"},{"action":"确认'抗高血压药稳定≥4周不强制洗脱'是否适用于所有抗高血压药物类别","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_6_6_1_2","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"抗高血压药不强制洗脱的适用范围"}],"heading":"允许的合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["允许合并用药具体清单","合并用药对终点判读影响评估标准"],"proposal_text":"本研究允许在双盲核心期及延长期全程使用剂量稳定的背景抗高血压治疗，包括受试者在筛选前已稳定使用≥4周的抗高血压药物，此类药物不要求洗脱。此外，受试者可按需使用非LUTS适应证的合并用药或治疗，前提是该药物不属于本方案规定的禁止合并用药或治疗范畴，且研究者判断其剂量稳定。α1阻滞剂经治不佳或不耐受的受试者可在完成≥2周洗脱后入组，入组后不再使用α1阻滞剂。所有允许使用的合并用药须在病例报告表中记录药物名称、剂量、给药途径、起止日期及适应证，研究者应评估合并用药对疗效终点判读和安全性评价的潜在影响。","rationale":"项目已确认事实包括：抗高血压药稳定≥4周不强制洗脱；两组全程允许稳定背景抗高血压治疗并按需非LUTS合并用药；α1阻滞剂洗脱≥2周；α1阻滞剂经治不佳/不耐受者可入组。允许合并用药的边界条件（非LUTS、剂量稳定、非禁止清单）来源于项目事实。具体允许药物清单及合并用药对终点判读的影响评估标准需医学经理进一步确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_8d26e523850a148d","section_number":"6.6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cc94b1aa4283601f64986120","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1111caf38b4339","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:06652cfb5d7add","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a58b77f78a8621","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:176c87031ef7e6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:79890fa298bcdd"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006194055_d0cff1fe","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充本项目禁止使用的合并用药及治疗完整清单，至少涵盖β3受体激动剂类、其他BPH/LUTS治疗药物（含植物制剂）、PDE5抑制剂（LUTS适应证）、抗胆碱能药、5α还原酶抑制剂及研究者手册中提示存在药物相互作用的药物","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_6_2_1","missing_source_classes":["禁止合并用药清单","药物相互作用数据","研究者手册"],"target":"禁止合并用药完整清单"},{"action":"明确受试者使用禁止合并用药后是否强制中断研究治疗、是否退出研究、是否鼓励继续随访及数据保留规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_6_2_2","missing_source_classes":["安全性管理SOP","方案实施手册"],"target":"使用禁止用药后的处理流程"}],"heading":"禁止的合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["禁止合并用药完整清单","使用禁止用药后处理流程SOP","药物相互作用数据","研究者手册中合并用药相关章节"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要列出本项目明确禁止的合并用药或治疗清单。允许来源中仅提供了洗脱要求涉及的药物类别（α1阻滞剂、PDE5抑制剂用于LUTS适应证、抗胆碱能药、5α还原酶抑制剂）以及入组标准中'不使用其他BPH/LUTS治疗药物（含植物制剂）'的概括性表述，但未给出完整的禁止合并用药清单、使用禁止用药后的处理流程及是否鼓励继续随访等实施规则。公司语料中涉及禁止用药处理的表述来自不同适应症（青少年特应性皮炎、其他）和不同分期（I期、II期），按语料泛化规则不得迁移其临床设计要求至本项目。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_3e154cdc77b188d3","section_number":"6.6.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cc94b1aa4283601f64986120","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1111caf38b4339","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:06652cfb5d7add","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a58b77f78a8621","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:176c87031ef7e6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:79890fa298bcdd"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"0ee2c185b322bc3f8b90cef03050139af3a64510df5fc435fcd662f0982ee42a","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_1e9851ab3c5d5a9d:full-draft:cc94b1aa4283601f64986120","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:cc94b1aa4283601f64986120","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:ae9cedc141106e5e430beb62d18a37b02195351499d3c84827d77781412af1cc:cc94b1aa4283601f64986120","text_sha256":"0ee2c185b322bc3f8b90cef03050139af3a64510df5fc435fcd662f0982ee42a"},{"content_sha256":"e8eb420597583eecf861b0865f05cd3125176647cb283075199484e144f000a4","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b0